#. translators: %s: the resource field's meta key, e.g. edbs_agenda_url.
#: includes/Admin/MetaBox.php:253
#, php-format
msgid "The linked post ID underlying %s's current value, when its source has one (e.g. a linked document) - 0 for a plain Media Library file or external link."
